      "mentions": 90,
      "title": {
        "en": "Empathetic emergency doctors and nurses"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Visitors overwhelmingly praise the compassionate emergency veterinarians and nursing staff for providing calm, empathetic care during stressful pet emergencies. Pet parents appreciate the emotional reassurance and clinical expertise, despite occasional frustration over high bills."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "waiting",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 48,
      "title": {
        "en": "Immediate intake with emergency prioritization"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers value the immediate nurse triage and rapid stabilization provided upon arrival in Lincoln Park. Most clients report being seen without delay, though non-critical cases during busy overnight surges can experience noticeable waits while severe trauma cases take priority."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 47,
      "title": {
        "en": "Open-floor model keeping families together"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners consistently applaud the open-concept hospital layout that allows families to stay directly beside their dogs and cats during assessments and stabilization. Clients note this transparent approach keeps pets calm and significantly relieves owner stress."
      }
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Can owners stay with their pets during emergency treatment?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, reviewers emphasize the open-concept facility that allows pet parents to remain by their pet's side throughout examinations and medical care."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Is the Lincoln Park location open 24 hours?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, clients confirm the facility operates 24/7 for acute emergency intake, trauma stabilization, and overnight hospitalization."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "What should pet owners expect regarding emergency pricing?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "While reviewers note that emergency care and diagnostics carry premium pricing, they highlight upfront cost estimates before treatments begin."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    }
